---
title: Create Your Taskip Account
sidebar:
  order: 1
---
Creating your Taskip account takes less than a minute and gives you access to your own agency workspace, where you can manage clients, projects, billing, team members, and more.

**Follow the steps below to get started:**

### **Step 1: Go to the Signup Page**

- Open your browser and visit - [https://taskip.net/register](https://taskip.net/register)
- Or click&nbsp;Get Started Free&nbsp;on the homepage.

### **Step 2: Enter Your Basic Details**

You will be asked to provide:

- Full Name
- Email Address
- Password

Make sure to use an email you have access to—this will be used for verification and account recovery.

### **Step 3: Verify Your Email**

Once you submit the form:

1. Check your inbox for a verification email from Taskip.
1. Click the&nbsp;Verify Email&nbsp;button inside the message.
1. After verification, you will be automatically redirected to the login page.

If you did not receive the email, check your spam/junk folder or resend from the signup page.

### **Step 4: Log in to Your Workspace**

After email verification:

1. Visit&nbsp;[https://taskip.net/login](https://taskip.net/login)
1. Enter your email and password
1. You will be logged into your new Taskip workspace

### **Step 5: Complete Initial Workspace Setup**

To finalize your setup, Taskip will guide you through a short onboarding flow:

- Workspace Name (your agency or brand name)
- Industry (optional)
- Workspace URL (auto-generated, you can customize it later)
- Logo upload (optional)
- Time zone settings

Once completed, your workspace is ready to use.
